  "label": "Meme Format",
  "description": "The meme follows a common format of using a shocking or absurd image with overlaid text to deliver a message. This format relies on the viewer's familiarity with internet memes and their conventions, which often use irony, satire, or shock value to convey a point. Understanding this format is necessary to interpret the meme's structure and intent.",
